 presence, are enforced by\n`tools/validate.py` and covered by deterministic generated cases.\nprotocol/core.md:153:to exactly one of `agent-skill-v1.schema.json` through\nprotocol/core.md:154:`agent-skill-v7.schema.json`. The legacy filename `csk-skill.json` has exactly\nprotocol/core.md:204:Schema 7 retains their exact schema-6 meaning so that local and external\ntools/validate.py:339:    if schema_name in {\"agent-skill-v7.schema.json\", \"csk-skill-v7.schema.json\"}:\nschemas/v1/agent-skill-v2.schema.json:3:  \"$id\": \"https://relux-works.github.io/curator-spec/schemas/v1/agent-skill-v2.schema.json\",\nconformance/v1/manifest.json:92:      \"path\": \"schema-cases/agent-skill-v1/invalid-v7-build-repositories.json\",\nconformance/v1/manifest.json:96:      \"path\": \"schema-cases/agent-skill-v1/invalid-v7-command-driver.json\",\nconformance/v1/manifest.json:100:      \"path\": \"schema-cases/agent-skill-v1/invalid-v7-command-repository.json\",\nconformance/v1/manifest.json:104:      \"path\": \"schema-cases/agent-skill-v1/invalid-v7-command-target.json\",\nconformance/v1/manifest.json:108:      \"path\": \"schema-cases/agent-skill-v1/invalid-v7-top-level-driver.json\",\nconformance/v1/manifest.json:112:      \"path\": \"schema-cases/agent-skill-v1/invalid-v7-top-level-repository.json\",\nconformance/v1/manifest.json:116:      \"path\": \"schema-cases/agent-skill-v1/invalid-v7-top-level-target.json\",\nconformance/v1/manifest.json:120:      \"path\": \"schema-cases/agent-skill-v1/invalid.json\",\nconformance/v1/manifest.json:124:      \"path\": \"schema-cases/agent-skill-v1/valid.json\",\nconformance/v1/manifest.json:128:      \"path\": \"schema-cases/agent-skill-v2/invalid-v7-build-repositories.json\",\nconformance/v1/manifest.json:132:      \"path\": \"schema-cases/agent-skill-v2/invalid-v7-command-driver.json\",\nconformance/v1/manifest.json:136:      \"path\": \"schema-cases/agent-skill-v2/invalid-v7-command-repository.json\",\nconformance/v1/manifest.json:14